  "description": "Custom workflow activity framework built on the Dataverse SDK abstractions.\n\nSource distribution. The .cs files are compiled into the consuming assembly, for\nDataverse custom workflow activities and on-premises deployments, which cannot\nuse plug-in packages. For every other consumer, reference JMCL.Dataverse.Workflow instead.\n\nIMPORTANT: NuGet does not flow contentFiles transitively. Reference ALL of these\npackages directly, not just this one:\n  JMCL.Dataverse.Workflow.Sources\n  JMCL.Dataverse.Sdk.Sources\n  JMCL.Core.IocContainer.Sources\n  JMCL.Core.ProcessModel.Sources\n  JMCL.Core.Net.Sources\n  JMCL.Dataverse.Data.Sources",
